34","line":26},{"title":"Radio Free Europe","target":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Radio_Free_Europe/Radio_Liberty \"Radio Free Europe/Radio Liberty\"","line":28},{"title":"\"'Kite Runner' Author On His Childhood, His Writing, And The Plight Of Afghan Refugees\"","target":"https://www.rferl.org/a/interview-kite-runner-afghan-emigre-writer-khaled-hosseini/24621078.html","line":28},{"title":"Telegraph.co.uk","target":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Telegraph.co.uk \"Telegraph.co.uk\"","line":30},{"title":"\"Despair in Kabul\"","target":"https://www.telegraph.co.uk/culture/3665261/Despair-in-Kabul.html","line":30},{"title":"\"Arts, Briefly; 'Kite Runner' Author To Release a New Novel\"","target":"https://query.nytimes.com/gst/fullpage.html?res=9C04E1D61F30F933A15753C1A9609C8B63&ref=khaledhosseini","line":32},{"title":"\"Jonathan Yardley: A THOUSAND SPLENDID SUNS\"","target":"https://www.washingtonpost.com/wp-dyn/content/article/2007/05/17/AR2007051701932.html","line":34},{"title":"\"A Thousand Splendid Suns: The plight of Afghan women only partially depicted\"","target":"http://www.wsws.org/en/articles/2009/08/thou-a08.html","line":36},{"title":"\"Critical Praise\"","target":"http://www.bookreporter.com/reviews/a-thousand-splendid-suns/praise","line":38},{"title":"Time","target":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Time_\\(magazine\\","line":40},{"title":"Grossman, Lev; Top 10 Fiction Books; time.com","target":"https://content.time.com/time/specials/2007/article/0,28804,1686204_1686244_1691855,00.html","line":42},{"title":"\"'Splendid Suns' burns brightly amid suffering\"","target":"http://usatoday30.usatoday.com/life/books/news/2007-05-21-thousand-splendid-suns_N.htm?csp=34","line":44},{"title":"\"Mariam and Laila\"","target":"https://www.nytimes.com/2007/06/03/books/review/See-t.html?ref=khaledhosseini&_r=0","line":46},{"title":"\"Behind the veil\"","target":"https://www.theguardian.com/books/2007/may/19/featuresreviews.guardianreview21","line":48},{"title":"\"Emotional Re